# FIPS 204 (ML-DSA) known-answer test vectors -- sigVer
#
# Source: NIST ACVP-Server, gen-val/json-files/ML-DSA-sigVer-FIPS204/internalProjection.json
#   https://github.com/usnistgov/ACVP-Server/blob/975de31eb83d87039ec88934fdc47d8c312b892d/gen-val/json-files/ML-DSA-sigVer-FIPS204/internalProjection.json
#   commit 975de31eb83d87039ec88934fdc47d8c312b892d (2026-08-12)
#
# This is a hand-picked subset of the official vectors, vendored so the test
# suite is hermetic (no network access in CI).  Field names and `tcId` values
# are preserved verbatim from the upstream JSON so cases can be traced back.
# All byte strings are lowercase hex; an empty value means a zero-length string.
#
# Only `signatureInterface: external` + `preHash: pure` groups are used.
# `testPassed = true` means the signature must verify; `false` means it must be
# rejected, and `reason` records which field upstream corrupted.
# Format: records start with a `[...]` header line, then `key = value` lines.

